<Base title="Home">
  <h1>Welcome!!</h1>
  <p>
    Worthy mortals, welcome to the homepage of 1972! Yes, yes, it's a weird name to you Earthlings, call me 'Sev'. 
    Here I'll provide live music worth leaving the house for, the modern 80s and 90s anime I've been watching to research your way of life,
    some nerdy saxophone projects I'm building, and more!
  </p>

  <h2>What's here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/events/">Gigs</a> - live music near me, refreshed weekly.</li>
    <li><a href="/anime/">Anime</a> - watched, and to watch.</li>
    <li><a href="/8bsl/">8 Bit Sax Lounge</a> - the stream, and how it works.</li>
    <li><a href="/projects/">Projects</a> - overly complicated analogue technical bits I've strung together.</li>
  </ul>

  <UnderConstruction note="Pardon the dust. More pages every week." />

  <VisitorCounter />
